1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:02,930
Your PoC bill isn’t your real bill. Four multipliers the demo hides.

2
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:11,260
Start from the PoC cost. Multiply by real volume, longer context, retries and tool calls, and eval runs on every change. Each looks small. Multiplied, they reshape the business case.

3
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:20,930
Estimate requests at full rollout, measure real prompt size, count calls per task including retries, and budget eval runs. Report cost per completed task, not per call.

4
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:25,930
Price it at full scale, before launch. Save this before you scale a PoC.
